==Strategy==
When you hit the base, do so with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to get his full Explosion off and deal huge amounts of damage to Jack Hammer. The Zang Roos here can be [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blasted]], drastically reducing their pushing power, while the Dark Otters can be countered with [[Pizza Cat]] and meatshielding. While Jack Hammer does have extremely high stats for the last few stages, this isn't much of a problem and mainly serves as a hindrance in terms of building your lineup, encouraging you to use quicker cooldown units like [[Can Can Cat]] and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] instead of Ubers, as well as potentially units with Survive like [[Cameraman Cat]].

